//! Adversarial regression for the arith→EUF fixed-value propagation fix
//! (`model_based_combination` merges an arith-pinned term into its constant's
//! EUF node so congruence fires). 60 QF_UFLIA cases, each verdict CONFIRMED with
//! z3, generated to stress the soundness-critical edges: off-path / decoy fixed
//! terms, distinct-value "diamonds", multiple independent merge classes, deep
//! nested chains, shared-constant vars, negative constants. The hard requirement
//! is ZERO spurious UNSAT (oxiz=unsat where z3=sat) on EITHER driver — the
//! dangerous direction. Run through both the legacy and the §4 hooks driver.
